{"suttaId":"thi-ap33","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[10124,10197],"vripara":"57"},"segments":{"thi-ap33:0.3":"Uppaladāyikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap33:1.1":"“Nagare aruṇavatiyā, aruṇo nāma khattiyo;","thi-ap33:1.3":"Tassa rañño ahuṃ bhariyā, ekajjhaṃ cārayāmahaṃ.","thi-ap33:2.1":"“Rahogatā nisīditvā, evaṃ cintesahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap33:2.3":"‘Kusalaṃ me kataṃ natthi, ādāya gamiyaṃ mama.","thi-ap33:3.1":"“‘Mahābhitāpaṃ kaṭukaṃ, ghorarūpaṃ sudāruṇaṃ;","thi-ap33:3.3":"Nirayaṃ nūna gacchāmi, ettha me natthi saṃsayo’.","thi-ap33:4.1":"“Evāhaṃ cintayitvāna, pahaṃsetvāna mānasaṃ;","thi-ap33:4.3":"Rājānaṃ upagantvāna, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","thi-ap33:5.1":"“‘Itthī nāma mayaṃ deva, purisānittarā ahu [purisānugatā sadā (sī.), purisā na bhavāma no (syā.), purisānaṃ bharā mayaṃ (pī.)];","thi-ap33:5.3":"Ekaṃ me samaṇaṃ dehi, bhojayissāmi khattiya’.","thi-ap33:6.1":"“Adāsi me tadā rājā, samaṇaṃ bhāvitindriyaṃ;","thi-ap33:6.3":"Tassa pattaṃ gahetvāna, paramannena pūrayiṃ.","thi-ap33:7.1":"“Pūretvā paramaṃ annaṃ, saha sugandhalepanaṃ;","thi-ap33:7.3":"Mahācelena chāditvā, adāsiṃ tuṭṭhamānasā.","thi-ap33:8.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap33:8.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap33:9.1":"“Sahassadevarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap33:9.3":"Sahassacakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap33:10.1":"“Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","thi-ap33:10.3":"Nānāvidhaṃ bahuṃ aññaṃ, tassa kammaphalaṃ tato.","thi-ap33:11.1":"“Uppalasseva me vaṇṇo, abhirūpā sudassanā;","thi-ap33:11.3":"Itthisabbaṅgasampannā, abhijātā jutindharā.","thi-ap33:12.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, ajāyiṃ sākiye kule;","thi-ap33:12.3":"Nārīsahassapāmokkhā, suddhodanasutassahaṃ.","thi-ap33:13.1":"“Nibbinditvā agārehaṃ, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap33:13.3":"Sattamīrattisampattā [sattamiṃrattimapattā (sī. syā. pī.)], catusaccamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap33:14.1":"“Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañca, paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;","thi-ap33:14.3":"Parimetuṃ na sakkomi, piṇḍapātassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap33:15.1":"“Yaṃ mayhaṃ pūritaṃ kammaṃ, kusalaṃ sarase muni;","thi-ap33:15.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, paricattaṃ bahuṃ mayā.","thi-ap33:16.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap33:16.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, piṇḍapātassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap33:17.1":"“Dve gatiyo pajānāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","thi-ap33:17.3":"Aññaṃ gatiṃ na jānāmi, piṇḍapātassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap33:18.1":"“Ucce kule pajāyāmi, mahāsāle [tayo sāla (ka.)] mahaddhane;","thi-ap33:18.3":"Aññe kule na jāyāmi, piṇḍapātassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap33:19.1":"“Bhavābhave saṃsaritvā, sukkamūlena coditā;","thi-ap33:19.3":"Amanāpaṃ na passāmi, somanassakataṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap33:20.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap33:20.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmune.","thi-ap33:21.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap33:21.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap33:22.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap33:22.3":"Ñāṇaṃ mama mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap33:23.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap33:24.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap33:25.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap33:26.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ uppaladāyikā bhikkhunī bhagavato sammukhā imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap33:27.1":"Uppaladāyikātheriyāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
